{"seq":1,"slug":"shill-bid-rig-detect","title":"托儿、围标与操纵识别","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/online-auction-marketplace/auction-fraud-ops/shill-bid-rig-detect","wordCount":2004,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"托儿-围标与操纵识别\">托儿、围标与操纵识别</h1><p>拍卖是少数几种「价格由参与者行为共同决定」的交易形态，因此它天然是操纵的靶子：卖家想抬价，可以自己或找人假装出价；一群竞买人想低价拿货，可以事先约定谁出价、谁陪跑。这两类操纵在数据上留下的痕迹不同——托儿制造的是「虚假的竞争」，围标制造的是「刻意缺席的竞争」——但它们的共同点是：<strong>只能从行为关系的结构里识别，无法从单条出价记录判断</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>两个术语必须先分清楚，因为它们的检测逻辑完全相反。</p>\n<p><strong>托儿出价（shill bidding）</strong>：与卖家有关联的人下假出价，目的是抬高价格。其典型行为是「挑起竞买人之间的价格战」（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Shill_bidding\">Wikipedia, Shill bidding</a>）。它增加的是「表面竞争度」。</p>\n<p><strong>围标（bid rigging）</strong>：本应互相竞争的出价人事先协调。美国联邦贸易委员会列举的常见形式包括：事先约定赢家、轮流当低价者（bid rotation）、约定某方退出（bid suppression）、提交高价的陪标（complementary / cover bidding）、以及把落败者通过分包安排补偿（<a href=\"https://www.ftc.gov/advice-guidance/competition-guidance/guide-antitrust-laws/dealings-competitors/bid-rigging\">FTC, Bid Rigging</a>）。它减少的是「真实竞争度」。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>托儿出价</th>\n<th>围标</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>操纵方向</td>\n<td>抬高成交价</td>\n<td>压低成交价</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>行为特征</td>\n<td>虚假竞争、频繁出价不出货</td>\n<td>轮流中标、出价整齐缺席</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>主检测信号</td>\n<td>卖家-竞买人关联、出价不获利</td>\n<td>竞买人之间的中标轮替、报价分布异常</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>主要受害方</td>\n<td>真实竞买人</td>\n<td>卖家</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[行为事件流] --&gt; B[出价层特征]&#10;  A --&gt; C[关系层特征]&#10;  A --&gt; D[结果层特征]&#10;  B --&gt; E[出价时机&lt;br/&gt;加价幅度&lt;br/&gt;上限分布]&#10;  C --&gt; F[同账号群&lt;br/&gt;同设备 同IP 同支付]&#10;  C --&gt; G[卖家-竞买人关联]&#10;  D --&gt; H[中标轮替&lt;br/&gt;中标后违约率]&#10;  D --&gt; I[成交价与市场价偏离]&#10;  E --&gt; J[风险分]&#10;  F --&gt; J&#10;  G --&gt; J&#10;  H --&gt; J&#10;  I --&gt; J&#10;  J --&gt; K{超阈值?}&#10;  K --&gt;|是| L[人工复核 / 自动降权]&#10;  K --&gt;|否| M[留痕]\">graph TD\n  A[行为事件流] --&gt; B[出价层特征]\n  A --&gt; C[关系层特征]\n  A --&gt; D[结果层特征]\n  B --&gt; E[出价时机&lt;br/&gt;加价幅度&lt;br/&gt;上限分布]\n  C --&gt; F[同账号群&lt;br/&gt;同设备 同IP 同支付]\n  C --&gt; G[卖家-竞买人关联]\n  D --&gt; H[中标轮替&lt;br/&gt;中标后违约率]\n  D --&gt; I[成交价与市场价偏离]\n  E --&gt; J[风险分]\n  F --&gt; J\n  G --&gt; J\n  H --&gt; J\n  I --&gt; J\n  J --&gt; K{超阈值?}\n  K --&gt;|是| L[人工复核 / 自动降权]\n  K --&gt;|否| M[留痕]</pre><h2 id=\"行为特征层\">行为特征层</h2><h3 id=\"从单条出价看不出问题\">从单条出价看不出问题</h3><p>一条出价本身无所谓正常与否。异常来自<strong>序列的结构</strong>，尤其是三类：出价时机是否总是踩在别人的出价之后、加价幅度是否总是最小一档、以及上限分布是否与被操纵标的的市场价高度不匹配。</p>\n<p>代理出价机制在这里提供了一个重要信号面：代理上限的分布是风控的天然输入，因为上限是「真实意愿」的最佳代理变量。一批账号在同一卖家标的上的上限呈现高度雷同的数值，其可疑度远高于出价次数多。</p>\n<h3 id=\"结构化特征\">结构化特征</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;feature_spec&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;bidder_level&quot;: [&#10;      &quot;bids_placed&quot;,&#10;      &quot;auctions_participated&quot;,&#10;      &quot;auctions_won&quot;,&#10;      &quot;win_rate&quot;,&#10;      &quot;median_increment_ratio&quot;,&#10;      &quot;seconds_before_close_median&quot;,&#10;      &quot;proxy_cap_variance_vs_peer&quot;&#10;    ],&#10;    &quot;pair_level&quot;: [&#10;      &quot;co_bid_frequency&quot;,&#10;      &quot;co_bid_lift&quot;,&#10;      &quot;times_a_outbid_b&quot;,&#10;      &quot;shared_device_count&quot;,&#10;      &quot;shared_payment_instrument&quot;&#10;    ],&#10;    &quot;seller_level&quot;: [&#10;      &quot;share_of_bids_from_top_k_bidders&quot;,&#10;      &quot;own_item_bid_share&quot;,&#10;      &quot;reserve_not_met_rate&quot;,&#10;      &quot;cancellation_rate&quot;&#10;    ]&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"feature_spec\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"bidder_level\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      \"bids_placed\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      \"auctions_participated\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      \"auctions_won\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      \"win_rate\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      \"median_increment_ratio\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      \"seconds_before_close_median\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      \"proxy_cap_variance_vs_peer\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"pair_level\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      \"co_bid_frequency\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      \"co_bid_lift\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      \"times_a_outbid_b\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      \"shared_device_count\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      \"shared_payment_instrument\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"seller_level\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      \"share_of_bids_from_top_k_bidders\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      \"own_item_bid_share\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      \"reserve_not_met_rate\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      \"cancellation_rate\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>seller_level</code> 里的 <code>share_of_bids_from_top_k_bidders</code> 是识别托儿最有效的单指标：若某个卖家的标的有极高比例的出价来自极少数账号，就值得深查。真正健康的卖家，出价者分布应该是长尾的。</p>\n<h2 id=\"关系图与团伙识别\">关系图与团伙识别</h2><h3 id=\"为什么要建图\">为什么要建图</h3><p>围标在出价记录上看可能完全正常——每个人出价都不多。可疑之处在于<strong>关系</strong>：这几个账号总在同一批标的出现、总在互相「配合」、且中标在它们之间轮替。这类信号在宽表里被淹没，在图上却是局部密集结构。</p>\n<h3 id=\"图结构定义\">图结构定义</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>节点</th>\n<th>边</th>\n<th>边权重信号</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>账号</td>\n<td>共同出价同一标的</td>\n<td>次数、时间接近度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>账号</td>\n<td>共享设备 / IP / 支付工具</td>\n<td>强关联（近似同一主体）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>账号 ↔ 卖家</td>\n<td>出价关系</td>\n<td>出价频次、是否从未成交</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>标的</td>\n<td>同一卖家</td>\n<td>归属</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>已有研究把这一类问题形式化为「多卖家串通」检测：既有的 Shill Score 只能评估单个出价人在某个卖家的拍卖中托儿的可能性，而多个卖家联合串通、把托儿行为分散到多个账号上，会稀释每个出价人的可疑度、从而降低其分数；有工作通过评估卖家之间的关联强度并据此调整参与出价人的分数，使串通不再能遮蔽行为（<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/1812.10868\">arXiv:1812.10868</a>）。这条思路对工程的启示是：<strong>分数必须做「群体归一化」</strong>，孤立地给单个账号打分会被分散策略绕过。</p>\n<h3 id=\"一个图查询\">一个图查询</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"WITH seller_bidders AS (&#10;  SELECT a.seller_id, b.bidder_id, count(*) AS n&#10;    FROM bid b&#10;    JOIN auction a USING (auction_id)&#10;   WHERE b.created_at &gt; now() - interval &#39;180 days&#39;&#10;   GROUP BY 1, 2&#10;),&#10;cluster AS (&#10;  SELECT seller_id, bidder_id, n,&#10;         sum(n) OVER (PARTITION BY seller_id) AS seller_total,&#10;         rank() OVER (PARTITION BY seller_id ORDER BY n DESC) AS rk&#10;    FROM seller_bidders&#10;)&#10;SELECT seller_id,&#10;       sum(n) FILTER (WHERE rk &lt;= 5)::numeric / nullif(max(seller_total), 0) AS top5_share,&#10;       count(*) AS distinct_bidders&#10;  FROM cluster&#10; GROUP BY seller_id&#10;HAVING count(*) &gt;= 5&#10;   AND sum(n) FILTER (WHERE rk &lt;= 5)::numeric / nullif(max(seller_total), 0) &gt; 0.8;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITH</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> seller_bidders </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">seller_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">bidder_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> bid b</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> auction a </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">USING</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (auction_id)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">created_at</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ></span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> interval </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'180 days'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">cluster </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> seller_id, bidder_id, n,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         sum</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(n) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">OVER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">PARTITION</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> seller_id) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> seller_total,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         rank</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">OVER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">PARTITION</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> seller_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DESC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> rk</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> seller_bidders</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> seller_id,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       sum</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(n) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FILTER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> rk </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)::</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">numeric</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> nullif</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">max</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(seller_total), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> top5_share,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> distinct_bidders</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cluster</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> seller_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">HAVING</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 5</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> sum</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(n) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FILTER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> rk </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)::</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">numeric</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> nullif</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">max</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(seller_total), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">8</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这条查询输出「出价高度集中于前 5 个账号」的卖家清单，作为人工复核的候选池，而不是自动处罚名单。</p>\n<h2 id=\"检测方法与处置边界\">检测方法与处置边界</h2><h3 id=\"三类方法\">三类方法</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>优点</th>\n<th>局限</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>规则 / 阈值</td>\n<td>可解释、易审计</td>\n<td>易被对抗、阈值僵硬</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>无监督聚类</td>\n<td>无需标注、能发现新形态</td>\n<td>结果难解释、需要人工确认</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>有监督分类</td>\n<td>精度高</td>\n<td>标签稀缺、正例极端不平衡</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>学术文献在这三个方向都有积累。有工作专门解决「标签稀缺」这个瓶颈：从真实的 eBay 拍卖抓取数据，用 CURE 层次聚类按多维特征系统性地为托儿行为打标，从而构造出高质量的托儿识别训练集（<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/1808.07288\">arXiv:1808.07288</a>）；也有工作把抓取到的商业拍卖原始数据清洗后公开发布为无标签训练集，让后续研究可以在真实商业数据上检验方法（<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/1806.00656\">arXiv:1806.00656</a>）。这两条合起来说明一件事：<strong>托儿检测的瓶颈不在算法而在标签与数据</strong>，工程上应当尽早开始沉淀自己的标注样本，而不是等到需要模型时才发现没有正例。</p>\n<p>机制侧的思路也值得关注：有工作用智能合约按九个出价行为算出 Bid Shill Score，并按可疑度缩放惩罚费，使操纵在经济上不划算、而诚实参与者几乎不被收费（<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2506.00282\">arXiv:2506.00282</a>）。这条路径的价值在于它<strong>绕开了识别难题</strong>——不追求判定谁是托儿，只让托儿行为本身变得无利可图。</p>\n<h3 id=\"举报面与举证责任\">举报面与举证责任</h3><p>平台对托儿的困难在 Wikipedia 条目里被点得很直白：平台通常难以可靠判定某个出价人是否与卖家有关联、或者干脆就是卖家本人（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Shill_bidding\">Wikipedia, Shill bidding</a>）。因此更重要的是<strong>降低操纵的收益</strong>而不是追求完美识别。一种思路是在机制层加经济惩罚：有工作用智能合约按九个出价行为算出 Bid Shill Score，并按可疑度缩放惩罚费，使操纵在经济上不划算、而诚实参与者几乎不被收费（<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2506.00282\">arXiv:2506.00282</a>）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"处置必须分级\">处置必须分级</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;disposition_ladder&quot;: [&#10;    { &quot;level&quot;: &quot;observe&quot;, &quot;trigger&quot;: &quot;score in [t1,t2)&quot;, &quot;action&quot;: &quot;留存证据&quot; },&#10;    { &quot;level&quot;: &quot;restrict&quot;, &quot;trigger&quot;: &quot;score in [t2,t3)&quot;, &quot;action&quot;: &quot;限制出价额度/降权展示&quot; },&#10;    { &quot;level&quot;: &quot;void&quot;, &quot;trigger&quot;: &quot;score &gt;= t3 &amp;&amp; human_reviewed&quot;, &quot;action&quot;: &quot;判定交易无效, 释放保证金&quot; },&#10;    { &quot;level&quot;: &quot;ban&quot;, &quot;trigger&quot;: &quot;confirmed_repeat&quot;, &quot;action&quot;: &quot;账号处置, 卖家清退&quot; }&#10;  ],&#10;  &quot;guardrails&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;no_auto_void_without_review&quot;: true,&#10;    &quot;appeal_window_hours&quot;: 336,&#10;    &quot;evidence_retention_days&quot;: 730&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"disposition_ladder\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"level\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"observe\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"trigger\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"score in [t1,t2)\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"action\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"留存证据\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"level\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"restrict\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"trigger\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"score in [t2,t3)\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"action\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"限制出价额度/降权展示\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"level\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"void\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"trigger\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"score >= t3 &#x26;&#x26; human_reviewed\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"action\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"判定交易无效, 释放保证金\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"level\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"ban\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"trigger\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"confirmed_repeat\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"action\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"账号处置, 卖家清退\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"guardrails\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"no_auto_void_without_review\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"appeal_window_hours\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">336</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"evidence_retention_days\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">730</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>no_auto_void_without_review</code> 是不可让步的一条。自动作废交易会损害真实买家，而误判的代价（信任流失）远高于漏判一场托儿。</p>\n<h2 id=\"与交易流程的接口\">与交易流程的接口</h2><p>风控不是一个旁路系统，它必须能在交易链路上「拦住」或「回滚」：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>时点</th>\n<th>可做的动作</th>\n<th>依赖</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>出价前</td>\n<td>拒绝、限流、要求额外验证</td>\n<td>实时风险分</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>出价中</td>\n<td>标记高风险、事后复核</td>\n<td>关系图查询</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>落槌前</td>\n<td>撤销异常出价、强制重判</td>\n<td>出价有效性判定，见 <a href=\"../proxy-bid-anti-snipe/bid-withdraw-rule\">出价撤回与有效规则</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>落槌后、结算前</td>\n<td>判定交易无效</td>\n<td>见 <a href=\"../auction-close-settle/winning-close-settlement\">中标判定与成交结算</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>结算后</td>\n<td>退款、追责、账号处置</td>\n<td>保证金处置，见 <a href=\"../auction-close-settle/auction-deposit-default\">拍卖保证金与买家违约</a></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>「落槌前撤销异常出价」这一档尤其重要：它能在成交前切断托儿抬价的收益链条。但撤销必须走与撤回相同的重算路径，否则会留下无人支撑的虚高价格。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>托儿抬高表面竞争度、围标压低真实竞争度，检测逻辑方向相反，不能共用一套阈值。</li>\n<li>单条出价无异常，异常藏在序列结构与关系结构里；代理上限的分布是重要特征面。</li>\n<li>卖家维度上「前 K 名账号出价占比」是识别托儿最有效的单指标。</li>\n<li>分散到多账号的串通会稀释单人分数，检测必须做群体归一化。</li>\n<li>规则、聚类、分类三类方法互补；标签稀缺使可解释规则仍是主力。</li>\n<li>处置必须分级，且交易作废必须经人工复核；平台难以完美识别关联，降低操纵收益比追求识别更现实。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"托儿、围标与操纵识别","id":"托儿-围标与操纵识别"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"行为特征层","id":"行为特征层"},{"level":3,"text":"从单条出价看不出问题","id":"从单条出价看不出问题"},{"level":3,"text":"结构化特征","id":"结构化特征"},{"level":2,"text":"关系图与团伙识别","id":"关系图与团伙识别"},{"level":3,"text":"为什么要建图","id":"为什么要建图"},{"level":3,"text":"图结构定义","id":"图结构定义"},{"level":3,"text":"一个图查询","id":"一个图查询"},{"level":2,"text":"检测方法与处置边界","id":"检测方法与处置边界"},{"level":3,"text":"三类方法","id":"三类方法"},{"level":3,"text":"举报面与举证责任","id":"举报面与举证责任"},{"level":3,"text":"处置必须分级","id":"处置必须分级"},{"level":2,"text":"与交易流程的接口","id":"与交易流程的接口"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"流拍处理与重新上拍","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/online-auction-marketplace/auction-close-settle/unsold-relist-flow"},"next":{"title":"拍卖专场与排期运营","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/online-auction-marketplace/auction-fraud-ops/auction-session-schedule"}}